WhiteSur icon theme, for tOS
============================

From https://github.com/vinceliuice/WhiteSur-icon-theme (commit 73d8040da51a9ed74e47c7366e7e9ff437601a5c),
by Vince Liuice and its contributors (AUTHORS), under the GNU General Public License v3 (COPYING).

Only the app icons tOS uses are here, renamed after the tOS app they stand for (svg/<tOS name     WhiteSur file
files        apps/file-manager.svg
terminal     apps/terminal.svg
notepad      apps/text-editor.svg
calculator   apps/calc.svg
paint        apps/gnome-paint.svg
media        apps/gnome-music.svg
netmon       apps/network-workgroup.svg
taskmgr      apps/utilities-system-monitor.svg
settings     apps/preferences-system.svg
viewer       apps/eog.svg
pdf          apps/gnome-documents.svg
sticky       apps/sticky.svg
clock        apps/preferences-system-time.svg
diskmgr      apps/gnome-disks.svg
snake        apps/gnome-nibbles.svg
2048         apps/2048.svg
doom         apps/applications-games.svg
about        apps/help.svg
launcher     apps/view-app-grid.svg
trash        places/user-trash.svg
trash_full   places/user-trash-full.svg
doc_folder   places/folder.svg
doc_text     mimes/text-x-generic.svg
doc_image    mimes/image-x-generic.svg
doc_audio    mimes/audio-x-generic.svg
doc_app      mimes/application-x-executable.svg
doc_generic  mimes/unknown.svg
doc_disk     devices/drive-removable-media-usb.svg
doc_hdd      devices/drive-harddisk.svg
rec_diskutil apps/gnome-disks.svg
